# QA-002: Recover a known acid spike from a weak-acid sample
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v2 HCl 0.0005mol
titrate v1 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.7 max 200
titrate v2 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.7 max 200
inspect
